name secnum
category Package
revision 61813
shortdesc A macro to format section numbering intuitively
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a macro \setsecnum to format section
longdesc numbering intuitively. \setsecnum{1.1.1} will set the section
longdesc numbering format to arabic.arabic.arabic and the depth to 3.
longdesc The package uses LaTeX3.
runfiles size=3
 RELOC/tex/latex/secnum/secnum.sty
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/GauSyu/secnum
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/secnum
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics headings expl3
